Nothing in this notice or EULA.md overrides those licenses, copyright notices,
source obligations, or rights that cannot be excluded under applicable law.

PUBLISHING AND DOWNLOADS

This public repository provides download instructions, agreements, notices,
installers and release verification. New proprietary development source is
maintained outside the public branch. Earlier commits remain accessible;
removing files from the current branch does not erase historical copies.
Updating this notice does not change previously granted rights or replace an
installer. See SOURCE-STATUS.md and RELEASE-NOTES.md for the release distinction.

